#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:930
msgid "Course title"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:931
msgid "Course slug"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:931
msgid ""
"The slug in the learn.wordpress.org course URL. This is the reliable signal; "
"the title is only a fallback."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:932
msgid "Completion phrase"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:932
msgid ""
"Both this phrase and the course must appear in the same profile history "
"entry, so someone who merely blogged about the course is not counted."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:936
msgid "Profile history filter"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:938
msgid "Milestones only (faster)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:940
msgid "All contributions"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:941
msgid ""
"Course completions are always milestone entries, so the faster filter reads "
"roughly 40% fewer pages. Switch to all contributions only if WordPress.org "
"changes and completions stop being found."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:944
msgid "Maximum history pages per mentor"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:944
msgid ""
"A mentor whose history is longer than this is reported as \"could not "
"check\", never as \"not completed\" — a false negative would leave them "
"waiting."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:945
msgid "Mentors per batch"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:945
msgid ""
"Each mentor can cost several requests to WordPress.org, so smaller batches "
"keep the screen responsive."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:946
msgid "Delay between requests (ms)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:947
msgid "Cache profile results for (seconds)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:947
msgid ""
"Only settled answers are cached; a failed read is always retried. Set to 0 "
"to disable."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:951
msgid "Weekly check"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:953
msgid "Run the check automatically once a week"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:955
msgid "Let the weekly check also promote mentors"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wpcpm-admin.php:956
msgid ""
"Both off by default. An unattended promotion writes to the shared Airtable "
"base, so turn the second one on deliberately."
msgstr ""

